NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000058 "at your option, any later version of Perl 5 you may have available."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000059 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000060 "Additionally, you are allowed to use the regexp generated by the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000061 "module in any way you want, without any restriction. For instance, you"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000062 "are allowed to copy it verbating in your program."
